================================================================================
ISSUES ENCOUNTERED AND RESOLVED
================================================================================

1. Issue: Pre-commit tflint failure - missing "Application" tag
   Resolution: Added "Application" tag to common_tags in locals.tf

2. Issue: ALB module target group attachment error - "Missing required argument: target_id"
   Resolution: Set create_attachment = false in target group configuration
   and managed attachments separately via aws_lb_target_group_attachment resource

3. Issue: SSH authentication failure when pushing to GitHub
   Resolution: Changed git remote from SSH to HTTPS protocol

